WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.860
- They finally found gravitational waves,

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.293
I couldn't believe it.

00:00:03.293 --> 00:00:06.559
Now, there is evidence, and
imagine all the history books,

00:00:06.559 --> 00:00:08.096
and how everything's gonna change.

00:00:08.096 --> 00:00:08.971
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:08.971 --> 00:00:12.202
- Excuse me, are you falling asleep on me?

00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:15.952
No, I'm definitely not
falling asleep right now.

00:00:17.102 --> 00:00:18.721
(upbeat music)

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.564
(alarm clock buzzing)

00:00:53.063 --> 00:00:53.866
(knocking)

00:01:03.515 --> 00:01:04.926
- So, what'd you do this weekend?

00:01:04.926 --> 00:01:08.596
- Nothing much, just
caught up on some stuff.

00:01:08.596 --> 00:01:10.144
(snoring)

00:01:13.383 --> 00:01:15.066
- You just slept all weekend, didn't you?

00:01:15.066 --> 00:01:17.075
- Yeah, yep, I just...

00:01:20.279 --> 00:01:22.612
(bluesy fiddle music)

00:01:42.471 --> 00:01:43.893
(upbeat jazz)

00:01:59.595 --> 00:02:01.796
(keyboard clicking)

